  "summary": "Malicious code in commonjs-code-token (npm)",
  "details": "The postinstall hook runs index.js, which fetches hxxps://access-token-delta[.]vercel[.]app and executes (eval) the `token` value returned in the JSON response. This downloads and runs arbitrary remote code at install time. The package advertises itself as an in-memory cache but contains no cache logic — only the remote code loader.",
